      <h1 class="article-title">On the Sole Government of God</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Justin Martyr (attributed) &middot; c. 2nd–3rd century</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">A treatise arguing for monotheism against polytheism, drawing on Greek poets and philosophers who acknowledged a single supreme deity.</p>
